[{"answer":"Excuse me, Mr. Morgan?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hi... uh... Lindsey, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Come in, Lindsey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't seen you in quite a while, have I?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/4.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well...if you have a few minutes...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I need you to help me sort out my credit hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/7.mp3"},{"answer":"It's kind of an, uh, an emergency.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/8.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, sit down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got a few minutes right now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/11.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what's the problem with your credit hours?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... um... I think I may not have the right ones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The ones I need to graduate, I mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/14.mp3"},{"answer":"What's your major again? Business Management?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, it's supposed to be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/16.mp3"},{"answer":"For Biz Ad, I still need to take Global Economics - EC 303","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and, well, I've got room for it in my schedule but, erm...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/18.mp3"},{"answer":"303's got a prerequisite, which I, uh, I haven't taken.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/19.mp3"},{"answer":"EC 203, Econometrics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's just great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/21.mp3"},{"answer":"And how did you manage that, Lindsey?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Not paying attention.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't notice until now that I needed 303 to graduate,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and didn't notice before that I needed 203 before.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything I can do now to fix this?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm not sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/27.mp3"},{"answer":"It's possible that the dean would let you take them concurrently.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/28.mp3"},{"answer":"It's been done before, in extremis.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's what I'm in - extremis.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/30.mp3"},{"answer":"The last term before graduation and I'm stuck.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think he would, really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It's possible, if your grades are good enough and everything else is in order.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Are they? Is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yeah! My GPA's 3.7.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/35.mp3"},{"answer":"And I've got all the other required credits, and then some.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I've actually taken more electives than I need to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm. Too many electives and a missed prerequisite.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Good work, Lindsey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, pretty dumb, eh?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/40.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well, they're both offered this term, I hope?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Global Economics is Tuesday through Thursdays at 3 pm","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/43.mp3"},{"answer":"and Econometrics is the same days at 11 in the morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Those would work fine, except, uh....","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Except what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Except I've already signed up for the second half of my statistics course:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Stats 202 at eleven.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that a required course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/49.mp3"},{"answer":"No, but it's highly recommended for business majors.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And I really need that math.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Math is my weak point, I'm afraid,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm going to use a lot of it if I go into finance like I want to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Lindsey, do you know what, um, Econometrics is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure! Uh... I guess... what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/55.mp3"},{"answer":"It's, uh, \"measuring economies\", \"econo\" plus \"metrics\", isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/56.mp3"},{"answer":"It's math, Lindsey. Statistics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a course in the kinds of statistics used in business, finance, and economics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... so maybe I don't need Stats 202 then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/59.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Biz Ad makes sure you get the necessary math by requiring Econometrics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/61.mp3"},{"answer":"But you've taken Statistics 201 already?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm. Listen, there may be another solution to this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/64.mp3"},{"answer":"The dean might accept Stats 201 and 202 in place of Econometrics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Really? That'd be great!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/66.mp3"},{"answer":"He might.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, I'm going to have to call his office about this, about both possibilities, right away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me just see what they say.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/69.mp3"},{"answer":"If you had a choice, which option would it be?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh... well, unless they really want me to take Econometrics,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it would be easier if I completed the second half of my statistics course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, then I'd have the whole course under my belt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/73.mp3"},{"answer":"But whatever the dean wants, I'm happy to do whatever it takes to graduate on time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/74.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, with two options, he may be more amenable to exempting you from the prerequisite.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you bring me a copy of your transcript later today?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got one right here, Mr Morgan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Here you go.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah. Mmm. Yes. it does look good, Lindsey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/80.mp3"},{"answer":"3.7 and a good scattering of 'A's, too!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/81.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. I'll arrange to see the dean as soon as I can,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/82.mp3"},{"answer":"if not today, then tomorrow morning, I hope.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/83.mp3"},{"answer":"And we'll try to get this straightened out for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Stop by tomorrow afternoon about three, will you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure! And thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/87.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. And don't worry too much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/88.mp3"},{"answer":"The dean can be quite flexible in a good cause.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/89.mp3"},{"answer":"See you tomorrow, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks so much, Mr Morgan.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/91.mp3"},{"answer":"See you tomorrow afternoon at 3.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/toefl-conversation-13-2023-04-12-17-32-45/92.mp3"}]
